t":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fla4vQjwBYVD3-AHAGnMFw","review_id":"PDdanXi8GhhjXrxGNb_uiw","date":"2018-01-27T03:18:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9447659850120544,"text_excerpt":"Had a great time at The Beach on Bourbon. The band (husband and wife) had the crowd going and can sing. They sang something for everyone (rock, pop, disco, r&b, old school, etc). They even had the crowd singing and the singers were on the dance floor dancing with us. All ages (21+), all walks of life were on the dance floor. The band and husband wife duo were FANTASTIC! the bouncers were cool. I didn't drink here as I had drinks other locations on Bourbon and know my limit. Yes, as I mentioned in my other review Shot girls are at every Bar location. The drinks are served throughout Bourbon bars in plastic dixie picnic cups. If your a beer drinker (served in larger plastic cups or in a bot..."},{"business_id":"fla4vQjwBYVD3-AHAGnMFw","review_id":"PNiHF4M7kffxhfgEQe6UcA","date":"2013-08-06T14:28:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9435319900512695,"text_excerpt":"The Beach on Bourbon is such a fun bar! It's got 2 bar areas and a dance room. We had a blast all over. DJ and music were awesome, drinks were good, atmosphere is poppin. It can be trashy or \"ratchet\" but hey you can see that anywhere, who cares, as long as you're with your friends and enjoying yourself. Stop by here for some fun!"},{"business_id":"fla4vQjwBYVD3-AHAGnMFw","review_id":"6j_ripc5WpOGX0lt6O1cBg","date":"2014-09-29T15:51:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9326611161231995,"text_excerpt":"I had SO much fun dancing the night away at the Beach on Bourbon. I wanted a chill place with live music and good drinks and that's exactly what I got. The dj/hype man was hilarious, the band was great, their singer was AMAZING-she actually sang part of one song without a mic--she was incredible, and the dance floor was fun. I can't speak to the weekend crowd, but I had a blast last Monday night, I would definitely go back next time we are in town."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fla4vQjwBYVD3-AHAGnMFw","photo_id":"2Nutt1CYIrp1KeSND6uRRw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2Nutt1CYIrp1KeSND6uRRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9078915119171143},{"business_id":"fla4vQjwBYVD3-AHAGnMFw","photo_id":"b3wYrIvNmwFZ5B94eHYyKA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/b3wYrIvNmwFZ5B94eHYyKA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8979153633117676},{"business_id":"fla4vQjwBYVD3-AHAGnMFw","photo_id":"0ipxfdkBGKU4c2PLOXczHw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0ipxfdkBGKU4c2PLOXczHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8786512017250061},{"business_id":"fla4vQjwBYVD3-AHAGnMFw","photo_id":"GByigXt5XqFD4luVjX-pSA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GByigXt5XqFD4luVjX-pSA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.862113893032074},{"business_id":"fla4vQjwBYVD3-AHAGnMFw","photo_id":"bpIWQt1s3ygiGMQAtARrcg","label":"inside","